sion_guard":"Preserve ownership of the lower-end requirement on the strengthened part of the main or intermediate ice frame.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"WRONG_APPLICABILITY","location":"gs:TRF047TransverseFrameShape and gs:TRF047FrameEndShape","problem":"The candidate imposes hasLowerEnd and mandatory supporting-structure attachment on all transverse frames/frame ends, rather than restricting the rule to the strengthened parts of main frames and intermediate ice frames covered by TRF-047.","required_change":"Scope the lower-end constraints to the relevant main-frame and intermediate-ice-frame strengthened-part paths.","regression_guard":"Do not impose TRF-047 obligations on unrelated transverse frames or frame ends.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"LOGIC","location":"gs:TRF047FrameEndShape/sh:property[nltl:hasAttachedSupportingStructure]","problem":"The unconditional sh:minCount 1 for hasAttachedSupportingStructure makes the stated intermediate-frame exception impossible: an applicable intermediate frame may use a horizontal member instead of attachment to the listed supporting structure.","required_change":"Encode the conditional alternative: direct attachment to an allowed structure, or, when termination is below a qualifying structure at or below the ice-belt lower limit, connection to an adjacent main frame by a horizontal member.","regression_guard":"Preserve the direct-attachment branch while allowing the explicitly limited intermediate-frame exception.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"OMITTED_SEMANTIC_ELEMENT","location":"gs:TRF047FrameEndShape/sh:property[nltl:hasHorizontalConnectionMember]","problem":"The candidate checks only that a horizontal connection member connects to an adjacent main frame and omits the mandatory same-scantlings-as-main-frames condition.","required_change":"Require same